// Calling a function this program defines: the right number of arguments, of
// the right types, and the right thing returned.
//
// These are the checks that need more of the callee than its return type --
// they need its parameter list -- which is why the symbol table carries a
// node id per function. Everything else in mid/ has only ever had to answer
// "what does this evaluate to"; this family answers "may it be written that
// way", and that is the difference between a diagnostic here and an
// undeclared-function error from `cc` about generated code.

chk_callsite(int id) {
  string s1_of_v = s1_of(id);
  int fn = func_node(s1_of_v);
  chk_site_at(id, fn);
} return void;
given argfn_match_call ((import argfn_call_match)):() then calls chk_arity:((import argfn_call_match), (import argfn_fn))
